<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>CBT Toolbox for Children &amp; Adolescents — 200+ Worksheets | PsychoReads</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Over 200 CBT worksheets &amp; exercises for Trauma, ADHD, Autism, Anxiety, Depression &amp; Conduct Disorders. Written by clinicians. Instant digital download for only $11." />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --teal: #0d9488;
      --teal-dark: #0f766e;
      --teal-deeper: #115e59;
      --teal-light: #f0fdfa;
      --teal-border: #99f6e4;
      --amber: #f59e0b;
      --amber-light: #fffbeb;
      --red: #ef4444;
      --text-main: #1c1917;
      --text-mid: #44403c;
      --text-light: #78716c;
      --border: #e7e5e4;
      --bg: #ffffff;
      --surface: #fafaf9;
    }

    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* Urgency bar */
    .urgency-bar {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0f766e, #0d9488);
      color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 12px 20px;
      font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2px;
    }
    .urgency-bar strong { color: #fcd34d; }

    /* Nav */
    .nav {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0 24px;
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 999;
    }
    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 62px;
    }
    .nav-logo { font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--teal-deeper); text-decoration: none; }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
      font-weight: 800; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; border: none;
      font-size: 1rem; font-family: inherit; transition: all 0.25s ease; text-decoration: none;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);
      color: #fff; padding: 16px 32px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(245,158,11,0.35);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(245,158,11,0.45); }
    .btn-sm { font-size: 0.85rem; padding: 9px 20px; border-radius: 8px; }
    .btn:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none !important; }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(150deg, #042f2e 0%, #0f766e 55%, #14b8a6 100%);
      padding: 70px 24px 60px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 20%, rgba(252,211,77,0.1) 0%, transparent 60%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hero-inner {
      max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 420px; gap: 48px; align-items: center;
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }
    @media (max-width: 860px) { .hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .hero-book { display: none; } }
    .hero-book { cursor: pointer; }
    .hero-book:hover img { transform: scale(1.02); transition: transform 0.25s ease; }


    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      background: rgba(252,211,77,0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(252,211,77,0.4);
      color: #fcd34d; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 800;
      padding: 5px 16px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 22px;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 900; color: #fff;
      line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: -1px;
    }
    .hero h1 span { color: #fcd34d; }
    .hero-desc { font-size: 1.1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.7; }

    /* Price */
    .price-row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .price-now { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: #fcd34d; letter-spacing: -2px; }
    .price-was { font-size: 1.2rem; text-decoration: line-through; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); font-weight: 600; }
    .price-save {
      background: #ef4444; color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 800; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px;
    }
    .hero-sub { font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .hero-sub strong { color: #fcd34d; }

    .hero-book {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 30px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }
    .hero-book img { max-width: 100%; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
    .hero-book-placeholder {
      width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 5rem;
    }

    /* Trust bar */
    .trust-bar {
      background: #042f2e; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center; gap: 24px 40px; padding: 26px 24px;
    }
    .trust-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .trust-icon { font-size: 1.1rem; }

    /* Conditions section */
    .conditions-section { padding: 72px 24px; background: var(--bg); }
    .section-label { text-align: center; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--teal); margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .section-title { text-align: center; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 900; color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .section-sub { text-align: center; color: var(--text-light); font-size: 1rem; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 48px; }

    .conditions-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .condition-card {
      background: var(--teal-light); border: 1.5px solid var(--teal-border);
      border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 16px; text-align: center;
      transition: transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
    }
    .condition-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(13,148,136,0.12); }
    .condition-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .condition-name { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--teal-deeper); }

    /* What's inside */
    .inside-section { padding: 72px 24px; background: var(--surface); }
    .inside-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .inside-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 26px 22px; }
    .inside-icon { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .inside-title { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--teal-deeper); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .inside-text { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.65; }

    /* Reviews */
    .reviews-section { padding: 72px 24px; background: var(--bg); }
    .reviews-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .review-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .review-card.featured { border: 2px solid var(--teal); background: var(--teal-light); grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .stars { color: #f59e0b; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .review-title { font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.97rem; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .review-body { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.7; flex: 1; font-style: italic; }
    .review-author { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--teal-dark); }
    .review-tag { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-light); margin-top: 3px; }

    /* Who is this for */
    .for-section { padding: 72px 24px; background: var(--teal-deeper); }
    .for-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .for-card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px 18px; text-align: center; }
    .for-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .for-title { font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .for-desc { font-size: 0.82rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); line-height: 1.55; }

    /* Guarantee */
    .guarantee-section { padding: 0 24px 72px; background: var(--bg); }
    .guarantee-box { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; background: var(--amber-light); border: 2px solid #fde68a; border-radius: 20px; padding: 36px 32px; text-align: center; }
    .guarantee-box h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 900; color: #78350f; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .guarantee-box p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.7; }

    /* CTA */
    .cta-section {
      background: linear-gradient(150deg, #042f2e 0%, #0f766e 60%, #14b8a6 100%);
      padding: 80px 24px; text-align: center;
    }
    .cta-section h2 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 900; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .cta-section p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .btn-cta { background: #fcd34d; color: #1c1917; font-size: 1.1rem; padding: 18px 44px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(252,211,77,0.35); }
    .btn-cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(252,211,77,0.5); }

    /* Sticky CTA */
    .sticky-cta {
      position: fixed; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 998;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96); backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 12px 24px;
      display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 -4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      transform: translateY(100%); transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }
    .sticky-cta.show { transform: translateY(0); }
    .sticky-label { font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-main); }
    .sticky-price { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 900; }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .sticky-cta { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; }
      .price-now { font-size: 2.8rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Urgency Bar -->
  <div class="urgency-bar">
    🎉 Special Price: <strong>62% OFF</strong> — Get it for only $11 instead of $29. Limited time deal!
  </div>

  <!-- Nav -->
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="nav-logo">PsychoReads</a>
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="checkoutProduct()" id="nav-btn">🛒 Get It for $11</button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badge">📋 200+ Worksheets &amp; Exercises</div>
        <h1>CBT Toolbox for<br><span>Children &amp; Adolescents</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          Hundreds of evidence-based worksheets, exercises, and activities to help treat Trauma, ADHD, Autism, Anxiety, Depression &amp; Conduct Disorders — written by clinicians with decades of experience.
        </p>
        <div class="price-row">
          <span class="price-now">$11</span>
          <span class="price-was">$29.00</span>
          <span class="price-save">SAVE 62%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-sub"><strong>⚡ Instant Digital Access</strong> &nbsp;•&nbsp; Works on Kindle, Apple Books, iPad &amp; PDF &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>🛡️ 30-Day Guarantee</strong></p>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="checkoutProduct()" id="hero-btn" style="font-size:1.1rem; padding:18px 40px;">
          🛒 Download Now — Only $11
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-book" onclick="checkoutProduct()" title="Download Now — Only $11">
        {% if product.images.first %}
          <img src="{{ product.images.first | img_url: '800x' }}" alt="{{ product.title }}" style="pointer-events:none;" />
        {% else %}
          <div class="hero-book-placeholder" style="pointer-events:none;">📋</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Trust Bar -->
  <div class="trust-bar">
    <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">📋</span> 200+ Worksheets &amp; Exercises</div>
    <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">🧒</span> Ages 0–17 Covered</div>
    <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">🏥</span> Written by Clinicians</div>
    <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">⚡</span> Instant Download</div>
    <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">🛡️</span> 30-Day Guarantee</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Conditions -->
  <section class="conditions-section">
    <p class="section-label">What it covers</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">One Toolbox.<br>Six Conditions.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Comprehensive CBT resources for every major childhood mental health challenge — all in one place.</p>
    <div class="conditions-grid">
      <div class="condition-card">
        <div class="condition-icon">💔</div>
        <div class="condition-name">Trauma</div>
      </div>
      <div class="condition-card">
        <div class="condition-icon">⚡</div>
        <div class="condition-name">ADHD</div>
      </div>
      <div class="condition-card">
        <div class="condition-icon">🌈</div>
        <div class="condition-name">Autism</div>
      </div>
      <div class="condition-card">
        <div class="condition-icon">😰</div>
        <div class="condition-name">Anxiety</div>
      </div>
      <div class="condition-card">
        <div class="condition-icon">🌧️</div>
        <div class="condition-name">Depression</div>
      </div>
      <div class="condition-card">
        <div class="condition-icon">🛑</div>
        <div class="condition-name">Conduct Disorders</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's Inside -->
  <section class="inside-section">
    <p class="section-label">Inside the toolbox</p>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Everything You Need<br>in One Resource</h2>
    <p class="section-sub" style="margin-bottom:44px;">Carefully organized by diagnosis and activity type — so you can always find the right tool for the right moment.</p>
    <div class="inside-grid">
      <div class="inside-card">
        <div class="inside-icon">📝</div>
        <div class="inside-title">In-Session Exercises</div>
        <div class="inside-text">Activities designed to be completed with the child during therapy sessions — structured, engaging, and clinically grounded.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="inside-card">
        <div class="inside-icon">🏠</div>
        <div class="inside-title">Homework for Clients</div>
        <div class="inside-text">Take-home worksheets that reinforce skills between sessions — usable at any age or stage in treatment.</div>
      </div>
