        <div class="inside-icon">🧠</div>
        <div class="inside-title">4 Core Skill Areas</div>
        <div class="inside-text">Cognitive Skills, Relationship Coaching, Competency Building, and Brain-Based Learning — all evidence-based CBT techniques.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

