        <div class="review-tag">Verified Purchase &nbsp;•&nbsp; 34 people found this helpful</div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <div class="review-title">"Life changing for my youth patients!"</div>
        <div class="review-body">"I'm a PMHNP in a rural area with very few therapists to refer to. Being able to use this resource with my youth patients has been life changing for them! Excellent book, easy to use. 10/10!"</div>
        <div class="review-author">— PMHNP</div>
        <div class="review-tag">Verified Purchase</div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <div class="review-title">"This is a must have for all therapists who work with kids!"</div>
        <div class="review-body">"I have relied on this book so many times when I was last minute planning for a session or needed inspiration. It's so easy to make photocopies of the pages to take into session. I love that it has so many different presenting problem sections (depression, trauma, etc)."</div>
        <div class="review-author">— Child &amp; Adolescent Therapist</div>
        <div class="review-tag">Verified Purchase</div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <div class="review-title">"I've been a child therapist for over 20 years. Well done!"</div>
        <div class="review-body">"I love doing hands-on and visual exercises with my clients. This book has so many activities I am excited to use! It's very well thought out and I love how caregivers are included in some of the pages."</div>
        <div class="review-author">— 20-Year Child &amp; Adolescent Therapist</div>
        <div class="review-tag">Verified Purchase</div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <div class="review-title">"Great tool for self awareness — helped my child with ADHD &amp; OCD"</div>
        <div class="review-body">"I use this at home for my child with ADHD and OCD. My child enjoys completing the worksheets and we follow up with a discussion. It has been a great tool for self awareness and has helped my child recognize triggers and find ways to manage situations before they get out of hand."</div>
        <div class="review-author">— Parent (AB)</div>
        <div class="review-tag">Verified Purchase &nbsp;•&nbsp; 12 people found this helpful</div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <div class="review-title">"I've been able to use it with clients from ages 6 to 17!"</div>
        <div class="review-body">"This book is easy to use and very helpful. I use it OFTEN. Its format allows room for you to add your own personal adjustments when needed to cater to a variety of clients. I've been able to use it with clients from ages 6 to 17, even my probation/juvenile detention clients."</div>
        <div class="review-author">— New Therapist (MemeC)</div>
        <div class="review-tag">Verified Purchase</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Guarantee -->
