    <p style="margin-top:14px; font-size:0.82rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">⚡ Instant Digital Access &nbsp;•&nbsp; 🛡️ 30-Day Guarantee &nbsp;•&nbsp; 🔒 Secure Checkout</p>
